Given the trajectory and the fact that the cannonball is still in the air in the last frame, it will continue to fly and hit the structure. The most likely target is the top robot (id 2), as it is the highest point in the structure and the cannonball's path is aimed at the structure. When the cannonball hits robot 2, it will destroy it. The impact may also cause the structure to collapse. Since robot 1 is below robot 2, it will likely be destroyed either by the direct hit from the cannonball (if the cannonball hits the structure at a point that also affects robot 1) or by the falling debris from the collapse of the structure above it. The ice blocks are brittle and will break under impact or from falling, and the wooden platforms will likely break or be pushed aside. Therefore, both robots will be destroyed.

